Package: devjam-gpu-x11-xlibre-tearfree-amdgpu
Version: 1.5-5
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Recommends: xlibre, devjam-gpu-x11-xlibre-dmabuf
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Tearfree improvements to the amdgpu driver
 X11 device section for the amdgpu driver with TearFree, atomic mode
 setting and variable refresh enabled and the shadow framebuffer
 disabled. Atomic mode setting needs XLibre or a patched Xorg.
